{"path":"filesystem/directory_entry/exists","title":"std::filesystem::directory_entry::exists","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::filesystem::directory_entry::</span>exists","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/filesystem/directory_entry/exists","section":"filesystem","kind":"page","summary":"Checks whether the pointed-to object exists. Effectively returns:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> exists<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> exists<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/error_code\"><span class=\"kw881\">std::<span class=\"me2\">error_code</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ec <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks whether the pointed-to object exists. Effectively returns:\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/exists\"><span class=\"kw2294\">std::<span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">exists</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>status<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>,</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/exists\"><span class=\"kw2294\">std::<span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">exists</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>status<span class=\"br0\">(</span>ec<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<p>Note that <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/directory_entry/status\"><code>status()</code></a> follows symlinks to their targets.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ec\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> out-parameter for error reporting in the non-throwing overload\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the referred-to filesystem object exists.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Any overload not marked <code>noexcept</code> may throw <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/new/bad_alloc\">std::bad_alloc</a></span> if memory allocation fails.<br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/filesystem_error\">std::filesystem::filesystem_error</a></span> on underlying OS API errors, constructed with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code> as the first path argument and the OS error code as the error code argument.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Sets a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/error_code\"><span class=\"kw881\">std::<span class=\"me2\">error_code</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span></code> parameter to the OS API error code if an OS API call fails, and executes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ec.</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/error_code/clear\"><code>clear</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> if no errors occur.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> str<span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"st0\">\"/usr/bin/cat\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"st0\">\"/usr/bin/mouse\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"st0\">\"/usr/bin/python\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"st0\">\"/usr/bin/bison\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"st0\">\"/usr/bin/yacc\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"st0\">\"/usr/bin/c++\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/directory_entry\"><span class=\"kw2223\">std::<span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">directory_entry</span></span></a> entry<span class=\"br0\">{</span>str<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"directory entry \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> entry\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>entry.<span class=\"me1\">exists</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" exists<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" does not exist<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>// Output on a POSIX system:\ndirectory entry \"/usr/bin/cat\" exist\ndirectory entry \"/usr/bin/mouse\" does not exist\ndirectory entry \"/usr/bin/python\" exists\ndirectory entry \"/usr/bin/bison\" exists\ndirectory entry \"/usr/bin/yacc\" does not exist\ndirectory entry \"/usr/bin/c++\" exists</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/exists\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>exists</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks whether path refers to existing file system object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"filesystem","title":"Filesystem library (since C++17)"},{"path":"filesystem/directory_entry","title":"std::filesystem::directory_entry"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::filesystem::directory_entry::exists","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++17. Checks whether the pointed-to object exists. Effectively returns:"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ec"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the referred-to filesystem object exists."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Any overload not marked noexcept may throw std::bad_alloc if memory allocation fails."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"exists","note":"checks whether path refers to existing file system object"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":210,"codeBlockCount":2}
